Hi,

Zhang, Zhenhua wrote:
> Hi,
> =

> HFP voicecall driver uses AT+CIEV indicator to notify call status
> update according to Bluetooth HFP spec v1.5. First version support
> single call, multi call support will be ready soon.
> =


I update voicecall driver a little bit. The changes are:

1. rename alloc_next_id and release_id by patch #2.
2. hfp_dial check clir and cug option and now return error if they are not
default value.
3. split single call notification into two functions, one for call notify a=
nd
another for callsetup notify.

Regards,
Zhenhua

